    "footnote": "Online F&B sales refer to the sales of goods where the order is received remotely and the price and terms of sale are agreed upon via online means, e.g. through company's website, third-party websites (e.g., online marketplaces, food delivery platforms), or mobile applications, regardless of how or where the goods are delivered or collected. This excludes orders made via telephone calls, facsimile, in-premise orders via kiosks or QR codes, and manually typed emails or messages. Payment may or may not be made online. Link to latest RSI/FSI release is available via www.singstat.gov.sg/find-data/explore-data-themes/industry/services/latest-news-data. Relevant methodology paper is available via www.singstat.gov.sg/find-data/explore-data-themes/industry/services/related-information.",
